    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# This workflow\nloads the current legal texts (stored on a private VPS as chunks.json) into the Supabase database via n8n.\n\n# Why?\nThe database is the source and single truth for the AI chat bot (see workflow: compliance-bot-chat).\n\nThe workflow is run again whenever a law changes, so the chat bot can always give up-to-date guidance.\n\n# Which laws?\n**Always all of them.** `chunks.json` holds GDPR (118 cards) and EU AI Act (179 cards), 297 in total, and every run writes all of them. Before a run the table is emptied (`truncate table documents restart identity;`), so the database always matches the file.",
        "height": 816,
        "width": 448,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "d99dd7b5-bbd5-4d01-a93b-5d93a6cb35b6",
      "name": "Sticky Note6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -784,
        -96
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## No filter\n\nAll cards go straight to the database. Same steps every time, no node to change.\n\nBefore the run: empty the table in Supabase (`truncate table documents restart identity;`).\n\nAfter the run: 297 rows (GDPR 118, EU AI Act 179).",
        "height": 464,
        "width": 288,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a752f91e-9faf-4471-9921-c0ef1934f2b1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
